    "backstory": "Born in the toxic swamps outside Subchain City, Gnash spent his hatchling days scavenging for scraps and DRIP. He learned early that survival meant being tougher and smarter than the other bottom-feeders. He now uses his mechanical skills to keep his hammer in top shape and smash anyone in his way.",
